  "description": "A comprehensive introduction to data mining covering the full KDD / CRISP-DM pipeline. Students apply six mining tasks — cleaning, association rules, clustering, classification, and text mining — to a 500,000-row health insurance dataset in R, using tidymodels, arules, randomForest, tidytext, and sparklyr.",
